h.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1034775-white-wolf-and-focus-home-interactive-to-release-video-game-adaptation-of-wta?p=1035893#post1035893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They just announced new Vampire, Wraith, and Mage mobile video games are coming as well. VERY excited about this.<br /> <br /> I wasn't expecting something gigantic off the bat. They need to get their feet wet first.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there a link to this? Couldn't find it with a search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T20:36:05-08:00","id":1035933,"title":"","content":"Here is an interesting tidbit that I pulled off the White Wolf site:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A general note about game development and publishing: it take can take several years to develop computer games and they are usually announced 6-12 months before the before release, when the publisher think is appropriate for maximum hype and market impact. </div> </div> </div>So the WtA Game is 6-12 months away, based on Paradox's method of determining when the announcement happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-s