2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T00:14:32-08:00","id":1035976,"title":"","content":"I've been waiting for that from cancelling heart of gaia. Focus home is a great news cause they know how to make good games - Styx, Deathwing. Upcoming Vampyr looks amazing I wonder why it's not a game in VtM universe. Cyanide made very fine Blood bowl 1 and 2. Gameplays from Styx 2 looks promising. Besides white wolf is part of paradox (pillars of eternity!) interacitive and I suppose that they won't allow to release poor game. And of course new Cthulhu trailers reminded dark corners of earth madness but much more intensive and I think it would be bestseller. That means I have a lot of hope for werewolf. I dream about game like pillars or shadowrun for werewolf. Creating a character and maby a pack. From all of tribes, auspices, totems, gifts and Rites! It would be awesome jawdropping fun. I just can't wait for 1-2 february for more news. I dreamed about CDRED (Witcher trilogy and Cyberpunk) making werewolf game but I'm excited anyway. The key word is : plot. With good story it would be good. But even the best graphic without cool story would be dissapointing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T02:10:01-08:00","id":1035984,"title":"","content":"So, some basic things that I will not want to see;<br /> <br /> - Heart of Gaia level of inaccuraties. Calling the White Howler bred cub &quot;Walks the spiral&quot;, Pentex called by name, flying BSDs with wings. Or just Warsinger and Raventongue being utterly weird.<br /> <br /> - Lack of lupus and metis. Or treating lupus as cave men and metis as only stupid fools. This is not Forsaken game, the two other breeds matter.<br /> <br /> - Character being outside of the sept culture. In Bloodlines, it worked. But I rather have actual sept politics involved.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T02:18:40-08:00","id":1035987,"title":"","content":"Wait what?! They are making a Werewolf game?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T09:48:20-08:00","id":1036129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurkhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1034775-white-wolf-and-focus-home-interactive-to-release-video-game-adaptation-of-wta?p=1035930#post1035930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-ic